# 🟥 **SECTION 3 — ROTATION METHODS (GAMEOBJECT)**

![Image](https://docs.unity3d.com/StaticFiles/ScriptRefImages/TransformRotate1.png?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

![Image](https://docs.unity3d.com/560/Documentation/uploads/Main/InspectorRotationEulerAngles.png?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

