![Image](https://media2.dev.to/dynamic/image/width%3D800%2Cheight%3D%2Cfit%3Dscale-down%2Cgravity%3Dauto%2Cformat%3Dauto/https%3A%2F%2Fdev-to-uploads.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fuploads%2Farticles%2F0feq9o59owt58a2zkftk.png?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

| Method                         | Description                    | Parameters                          | Example                                                                                              |
| ------------------------------ | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **transform.Rotate()**         | Adds rotation every frame      | `x, y, z` degrees, optional `Space` | `transform.Rotate(0, 90 * Time.deltaTime, 0);`                                                       |
| **transform.eulerAngles**      | Instant set rotation           | `Vector3(x, y, z)`                  | `transform.eulerAngles = new Vector3(0, 45, 0);`                                                     |
| **Quaternion.Euler()**         | Safe rotation (no gimbal lock) | `x, y, z` degrees                   | `transform.rotation = Quaternion.Euler(0, 45, 0);`                                                   |
| **Quaternion.LookRotation()**  | Rotate to face direction       | `(forwardDirection)`                | `transform.rotation = Quaternion.LookRotation(targetDir);`                                           |
| **transform.LookAt()**         | Rotate to face object          | `(targetTransform)`                 | `transform.LookAt(player);`                                                                          |
| **Quaternion.Lerp()**          | Smooth rotation                | `(current, target, t)`              | `transform.rotation = Quaternion.Lerp(transform.rotation, targetRot, 0.1f);`                         |
| **Quaternion.Slerp()**         | Natural, realistic rotation    | `(current, target, t)`              | `transform.rotation = Quaternion.Slerp(transform.rotation, targetRot, 0.1f);`                        |
| **Quaternion.RotateTowards()** | Rotate at fixed degrees/sec    | `(current, target, degrees)`        | `transform.rotation = Quaternion.RotateTowards(transform.rotation, targetRot, 90 * Time.deltaTime);` |

